  "sn35.89:1.1": "A monk called Bāhiya appears in a similar discourse at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn47.15/en/sujato'>SN 47.15</a>. In both cases he is said to become an arahant. It may be that these are different versions of the same event. The Bāhiya Dārucīriya famed from <a href='https://suttacentral.net/ud1.10/en/sujato'>Ud 1.10</a> must be a different person, since he died immediately. ",
